# Normalize line endings on commit. Windows tooling rewrites pulled files as
# CRLF, and with core.autocrlf=false git records those rewrites as whole-file
# diffs (a symmetric N insertions / N deletions diffstat is the signature).
# That churn blocks `git am`, inflates review diffs, and makes the cloud.gov
# copy of app.js roughly 3 KB larger than the GitHub Pages copy.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
